<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Woolworths half yr net rises 8.6 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Woolworths half yr net rises 8.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>28 weeks ended Jan 5</p>
<p>		  (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  233.7 vs 214.8</p>
<p>    Net profit			  147.5 vs 135.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		    7.0 vs 7.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Woolworths Ltd is a grocery retailer.</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)		    8.22 vs 7.57</p>
<p>    Other income			155.7 vs 119.4</p>
<p>    Tax				    86.1 vs  78.9</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		     nil  vs nil</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 13.42 vs 12.79</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date April 24</p>
<p>Reg date April 2</p>
<p>    Interest			     25.1 vs  18.7</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 92.0 vs  80.1</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
